inal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\forall\\alpha\\in S\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha))\\land\\exists B\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,S,B)\\land\\forall\\beta\\in B\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\bigr)\">\\((\\forall\\alpha\\in S\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha))\\land\\exists B\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,S,B)\\land\\forall\\beta\\in B\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\bigr)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Regressive}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Regressive}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"aa5065a1f0bd9a7f\" href=\"?note=aa5065a1f0bd9a7f\" title=\"58-df-regressive-function.md\">58-df-regressive-function.md</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\coloneqq\\varnothing\">\\(0\\coloneqq\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regressive}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Regressive}_S(f,S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\alpha\\in S\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(f(\\alpha)\\in\\alpha).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regressive}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Regressive}_S(f,S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\alpha\\in S\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(f(\\alpha)\\in\\alpha).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>恢复仍被导航引用的旧文件名。沿用合并目标的回归函数谓词，不增加非零点以外的回归条件，也不另造同名谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-regressive-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"aa5065a1f0bd9a7f","anchor":"ref-1","tar